1. DESIGN SPECIFICATIONS: ACI 318-19 (STRUCTURAL CONCRETE) & ASCE 7-22.\P\P2. CONCRETE GRADES (28-DAY CYLINDER COMPRESSIVE STRENGTH f'c):\P   - COLUMNS & BEAMS: f'c = 28 MPa (4000 psi), NORMAL WEIGHT CONCRETE\P   - FOOTINGS & SLABS: f'c = 28 MPa (400
  3
0 psi)\P   - PLAIN CONCRETE LEVELLING COURSE (PCC): M10 (10 MPa, 75mm THICK)\P\P3. REINFORCING STEEL: ASTM A615 / A706 GRADE 60 (fy = 420 MPa / 60 ksi).\P\P4. NOMINAL CLEAR CONCRETE COVER TO MAIN REINFORCEMENT:\P   - FOOTINGS CAST AGAINST EARTH: 75 m
  3
m (3.0 in.)\P   - COLUMNS & BEAMS (TO OUTER TIES/STIRRUPS): 40 mm (1.5 in.)\P   - SLABS & STAIRCASES: 20 mm (0.75 in.)\P\P5. DEVELOPMENT & SPLICES: MINIMUM CLASS B TENSION LAP SPLICE Ld = 48*db.\P   COLUMN SPLICES PERMITTED ONLY IN MIDDLE HALF OF STO
  3
RY CLEAR HEIGHT.\P\P6. SEISMIC HOOKS: ALL TIES & STIRRUPS SHALL HAVE 135° HOOKS (>= 6*db EXTENSION).\P\P7. FOUNDATIONS: NET ALLOWABLE SOIL BEARING CAPACITY = 200 kPa (4.0 ksf).\P\P8. GENERAL: ALL DIMENSIONS IN MILLIMETERS UNLESS NOTED. DO NOT SCALE W
  1
RITTEN DRAWINGS.
